  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>待ちなさい、プラッタ！
あなたまで私を裏切るのッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, Platta! Don't tell me YOU'RE betraying me too?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53484</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ニャー……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meow...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>プレーナ……
炎雷爆薬を渡してちょうだい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Prehna... please, give us the gunpowder.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……おあいにくね。
さっきのが最後の一発よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I'm afraid I can't. We're fresh out.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58628</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>開発者であるあなたなら
同じものをつくれるのでは
ないですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As it's engineer, surely you could simply create some more?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>59336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あなたは……
リチア＝スポデューン？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A-Are you... Lithia Spodune?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>59336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ふふ、相変わらず
&lt;Ines&gt;は、どんな人からも
信頼されているようね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Heh, I see Ines has everyone wrapped around her little finger, as usual...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>59704</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうね、必要な素材を
集めてきたら炎雷爆薬を
つくってあげてもいいわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Fine, if you can gather the materials needed to craft it, I'll make some for you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>59704</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まず必要なのは
『炎念石』と『雷念石』よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>First things we'll need are a Flame Stone and a Thunder Stone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>60144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あっ、そのふたつなら持ってるよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, we have both of those!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>60440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>炎念石と雷念石か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A Flame Stone and Thunder Stone, got it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>60728</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そのふたつなら、城の
地下倉庫にも保管されているはずだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We should be able to find both of those in the castle's underground storeroom.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そして、肝心なのは
炎雷爆薬の『調合レシピ』——</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then the most important part, the mixing method.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>詳細な調合データを記録した
メモを、たった今プラッタに
持ち去られてしまったのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Platta just ran off with a memo full of detailed instructions.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61360</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっきのネコ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You mean that cat from before?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふふ……笑っていいわよ。
私は十年も一緒に暮らした
飼いネコにも裏切られちゃったの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh... go ahead and laugh. I lived with that cat for ten long years, yet she still stabbed me in the back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61852</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>プラッタからレシピを取り返せば
炎雷爆薬を調合してくれるのね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So if we get the formula back from Platta, you'll make us some more?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>62036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……さぁ？
約束をしなきゃいけない
義理はないはずだけど？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Maybe. It's not like I have any obligation to help you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>62568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わかった。
とにかく素材とレシピを
集めてくるわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Alright. We'll go gather everything needed.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>69108</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……素材と調合メモは揃ったの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Have you brought everything?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>69644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええ。
でも、渡す前に約束してもらうわ。
自爆なんてしないって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes. But before we hand it over, you need to promise me something. Promise you're not going to blow yourself up along with it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>70368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……どうしてそれを？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Why so specific?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>70720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ニャァ…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meow...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>71044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なるほど、ソーマで
プラッタのスピリアを覗いたのね？
昔、私にしたのと同じように</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, you must've have used your Soma to peek into Platta's Spiria, just like you once did to me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>71752</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あの時の事は謝るわ。
ひとりで悩んでいる
あなたが心配だったのよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I'm sorry for back then. I was worried about you for shouldering everything on your own...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>驚いたでしょ？
こっそり忍びこんだ
私のスピリアは————</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Must've been quite the surprise, no? What you saw in my Spiria...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アイザック先輩への想いと
あなたへの嫉妬で
いっぱいだったんだから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The feelings for Isaac, and the jealousy of what you two had...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……でも、私が一番許せないのは
私の想いを理由に、あなたが
先輩に告白するのをやめた事よッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But the one thing I won't forgive is that you never told Isaac how you felt because of MY feelings!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あなたなら先輩のスピリアに
手が届いたはずなのに……
こんな屈辱ってないわ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If it came from you, I'm sure you could have reached his Spiria... you'd have nothing to be ashamed of!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……いいえ、事実はもっとひどい。
あの頃、私は先輩の
パールさんへの想いを知ったの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...No, I'm afraid the truth was even worse. Around then was when I found out about his feelings for Pearl.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は、自分が傷つかないよう
あなたを言い訳にして
…………逃げたのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I used you as an excuse to run away... so I wouldn't get hurt.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>73188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だったら、ずっと逃げてなさい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then keep on running!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>73188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうせ世界は、もうすぐ滅ぶ……
けど、帝国を破壊するのは
化物どもじゃない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This world doesn't have long left... but it won't be the beasts that topple the empire.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>73188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>先輩の遺産と意思を継いだ私よ！
素材とメモを渡してッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll carry on his legacy, and make his wish come true! Now hand over the materials and note!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>逃げないわよ！　こんな私でも
スピリアを閉ざさずに伝えれば
先輩を救う力になれたのッ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll never run again! If I hadn't closed off my Spiria and told him how I felt, that could have been what saved him!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう自分の想いが届かないなんて
あきらめたりしない!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's why I'm not going to give up on making my feelings reach YOU!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>死んじゃ嫌よ、プレーナ！
同じ人を好きになって
同じ夢を見た、大切な友達——</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't want you to die, Prehna! You're my dearest friend. We chased the same dream, and even fell for the same man... </EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……それに世界は滅びないわ。
ゼロムもガルデニアも蹴散らして
私が守ってみせる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...And I won't let the world end, either. I'll smash the xerom and Gardenia to bits and protect everyone!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>目覚めたラピスに
先輩がどれほど彼女を愛していたか
伝える未来のために！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For a future where Lapis wakes up, and I can tell her just how much her father loved her!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ニャァーーー……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meow...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何よ……スピリアまでそんなに
強くなられたら、私があなたに
勝てる事は、もう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What gives... with a Spiria that strong, even I don't stand a chance against you anymore...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あなたみたいな
嫌味な人に付き合う
我慢強さくらいのもの……ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's way too much trouble trying to argue with someone like you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>調合代は高いわよ？
炎雷爆薬は
軍の機密兵器なんだから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But the cost of synthesis is pretty high. It is a military secret, after all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77616</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わかってるわ。
学生時代から寝かせてる
秘蔵のグミ焼酎でどうかしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's fine. How about some of my precious Gel liquor I've been saving since our days in the academy?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……いい、プラッタ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Sound good, Platta?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>78560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ニャァ〜〜〜♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Meow~! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>81768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>出来たわ。この量の炎雷爆薬なら
あの軟体ゼロムを焼き尽くせる
はずよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's done. This amount should be enough to burn that xerom to ashes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>82624</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとう、プレーナさん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you so much, Prehna!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……信じていいの？
本当は城ごと吹き飛ばすような
調合をしたかもしれないわよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You'd believe me that easily? For all you know I could have made a formula that would make the whole castle go up in flames.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>シルバさんは、守るための力が
欲しかったって言ってた——</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Silver said he wanted the power to protect those he loved.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その想いを受け継いだ
プレーナさんが
そんな事するはずないさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you inherrited those feelings, I know you'd never do something like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………&lt;Ines&gt;。
あなた、どこでこんな
純真な若い子をつかまえたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ines, where did you find such pure little boy?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>84104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うふふ、いいでしょ♪
欲しかったら
勇気を出して告白してみたら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehe, isn't he the sweetest? ♪ If you want him, how about you muster up the courage and confess?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>84536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こ、告白なんてだめッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>N-No!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>86136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今の気持ちを真っ直ぐ
育ててね……私みたいに
ひねくれさせちゃだめよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You should nurture your honest, straightforward feelings... don't let them become twisted like mine did.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>86576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……はい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I will!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
